> How is {la ka trina} distinguishable from {la .kaTRIna.}?

It's not, as they're the same thing.  "{.kaTRIna.}" ends in a vowel,  
so despite the trailing period, it's not a {cmevla}, and so it gets  
broken up into "{ka trina}."

